<div id="about">
  <section class="section--height section--purple--yellow">
    <div class="container d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">
      <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end align-items-start">
        <h1 class="mb-0 fw-bold greeting">hello</h1>
        <h1 class="fw-bold greeting greeting--bottom">sunshines</h1>
      </div>
      <%= image_tag 'woman.svg', class: "woman" %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section--height">
    <div class="row m-0 h-100">
      <div class="col-6 m-0 p-0">
        <div class="flower-container position-relative">
          <%= image_tag "flowers.svg", class: "flower-image position-absolute" %>
          <%= image_tag "blobs.svg", class: "blobs-image position-absolute" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-6 m-0 p-0">
        <div class="about-container position-relative h-100 d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
          <%= image_tag "blob-blue.svg", class: "blue-blob" %>
          <%= image_tag "yellow-blob.svg", class: "yellow-blob" %>
          <div class="position-absolute yellow-blob-cover"></div>
          <div class="px-4 w-75 z-index-above">
            <h5 class="mb-0">I'm Soraya founder of Sunchef</h5>
            <h5>and a certified holistic health coach.</h5>
            <p>I'm here to help you understand how to find your balance. There is no one size fits all formula - your journey is unique to you. It is always crucial, however, to understand our own agency - our health is a vehicle and we are able to navigate it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="p-5">
    <h2 class="fw-bold">It started with a growing curiosity..</h2>
    <p>My journey of enlightenment towards holistic health began when I became curious about how the food I ate made me feel, and how it affected my body. Once this seed was planted and I started to understand the relationship between what I eat and my overall wellbeing, I became hungry for more information. This is where my education in holistic health through Integrative
Nutrition began.</p>
    <p>What stuck with me most is the fact that it all starts with what goes into your body. In other words - food.
How you eat is essential to creating balance in your life - it has the ability to nurture or hinder your experience. </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section--green p-5">
    <div class="row m-0">
      <div class="col-5">
        <%= image_tag "pepper-yellow.svg", alt: "yellow pepper", class: "yellow-pepper" %>
      </div>
      <div class="col-7">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center h-100">
          <div>
            <p>Sunchef's mission is to help you <span class="text-green">become an expert on you!</span> Together, we can design a personalised path towards the best version of yourself, and inspire you to find pleasure in cooking.</p>
            <p>Remember: healthy food doesn have to compromise on taste!</p>
            <p class="green-quote">-</p>
            <p class="green-quote">Health and happiness are always just around the corner.</p>
            <p class="text-success fst-italic fs-1 text">Only if you're-ready :)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="p-5">
      <div class="row m-0">
        <div class="col-7">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-end justify-content-end">
            <%= image_tag "soraya.png", alt: "Soraya", class: "w-75 soraya-image" %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-5">
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
            <%= image_tag "logo.png", alt: "logo", class: "w-25" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="block-yellow"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="p-5"></section>
</div>
